ac resynchronization therapy: a study using cardiovascular magnetic resonance tissue synchronization imaging</article-title><source>J Am Coll Cardiol</source><year>2007</year><volume>50</volume><fpage>243</fpage><lpage>252</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17631217</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.jacc.2007.03.035</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>